Learn how to code like Bubbles the powerpuff girl! In this tutorial I will show you how to use Scratch and the Cartoon Network Powerpuff Girl character assets to make a reaction time test game! 

Finished game can be seen here: https://scratch.mit.edu/projects/112111391/
